      "sourceTextSha256": "f9fef5eeb184f2a3b72d41f0e63175a6b052fda62ae0fbbabffd5a1a62550490",
      "text": "Day 3 · Río Celeste: legend has it that when God was painting the sky, He washed His brushes in this river, now called the “sky-blue river”. A hike through the humid forest of Tenorio Volcano National Park, observing its flora and fauna, leads to Los Teñideros, where the river turns turquoise, and to the Río Celeste waterfall, one of the most beautiful in Costa Rica: one of the best short hikes in the country, ideal for lovers of the outdoors. Overnight at Tenorio Lodge. (B)",
