      "text": "Day 4 · A cultural visit to the indigenous Maleku people of Costa Rica: traditional dances, arts and crafts such as drums, carved gourds, ceramics, woven baskets and tapestries. Transfer to Arenal Volcano. Overnight at Arenal Paraíso Resort & Spa. (B, L)",
